      "pali": "1. Āhuneyyavagga ",
      "english": "1. Worthy of Offerings "
    },
    {
      "number": 3,
      "pali": "Anussatiṭṭhānasutta ",
      "english": "Topics for Recollection "
    },
    {
      "number": 4,
      "pali": "“Chayimāni, bhikkhave, anussatiṭṭhānāni. ",
      "english": "“Mendicants, there are these six topics for recollection. "
    },
    {
      "number": 5,
      "pali": "Katamāni cha? ",
      "english": "What six? "
    },
    {
      "number": 6,
      "pali": "Buddhānussati, dhammānussati, saṅghānussati, sīlānussati, cāgānussati, devatānussati. ",
      "english": "The recollection of the Buddha, the teaching, the Saṅgha, ethics, generosity, and the deities. "
    },
    {
      "number": 7,
      "pali": "Imāni kho, bhikkhave, cha anussatiṭṭhānānī”ti. ",
      "english": "These are the six topics for recollection.” "
    },
    {
      "number": 8,
      "pali": "Navamaṁ. ",
      "english": ""
    }
